  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Robert Zellinger de Balkany was a French property developer who introduced the American shopping-centre model to France. After studying architecture in the United States, he developed Parly 2 and founded Shopping Center Company. He expanded the format through major retail and residential complexes across France, other European markets and the Middle East.",
